{"id":"en_when-old-love-comes-knocking","title":"When Old Love Comes Knocking","titleEn":"When Old Love Comes Knocking","description":"Fu Sijin defies his family out of love for Su Munnuan, but the two are driven apart when she departs to protect his life. Unbeknownst to him, she gives birth to twins, a boy and a girl, and the son is taken from her. Six years pass before the couple finds each other again. Fu's desire for revenge and Zhu Ling's plotting stand in their way, yet the truth eventually comes to light. With the misunderstandings resolved, they marry and the family of four is finally whole.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/when-old-love-comes-knocking/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/when-old-love-comes-knocking/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Enemies to Lovers","Second Chance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcxzc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_when-old-love-comes-knocking_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcxzc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_when-old-love-comes-knocking_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcxzc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_when-old-love-comes-knocking_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcxzc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_when-old-love-comes-knocking_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcxzc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","down